[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724765214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114745#issuecomment-3724765214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114745","id":3724765214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eA2ge","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T16:53:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T16:53:29Z","body":"Can confirm on `v4.6.beta3`. Attempting to use `Input.is_action_pressed` for such an action never returns `true`. Also tried setting the input action to `Shift+Plus (Unicode)`, but to no avail.\n\nBut, that's on US layout, which requires me to press <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>+ =</kbd> to get that unicode value (43 -> `+`). On a Portuguese layout, I only need to press <kbd>* +</kbd> to input `+`, and in that scenario it works as expected:\n\n| US Layout | Portuguese Layout |\n|-|-|\n|<img width=\"950\" height=\"802\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc4443e7-3cc5-457d-9a5b-5327e77ca900\" />|<img width=\"934\" height=\"804\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ec7a40f-ba60-4efc-b318-b04d749582cb\" />|","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3724765214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725003371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114745#issuecomment-3725003371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114745","id":3725003371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eBwpr","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:53:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T17:53:36Z","body":"This is fully expected result, since `Shift` + `=` have Shift modifier, it won't trigger `Unicode +`, it will be triggered only by single key (without modifiers) emitting `+` character.\n\nUnicode events are intended for text input, and probably should not be exposed in the event map at all.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725003371/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4933456063","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114745#issuecomment-4933456063","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114745","id":4933456063,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJg6Qvw","user":{"login":"Mambouna","id":134105754,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_5Kmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134105754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna","html_url":"https://github.com/Mambouna","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mambouna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T08:24:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T08:24:47Z","body":"@bruvzg Apologies if this comes out of nowhere. I had the same problem just now. If this is intended behavior, how does one define input events that are independent from keyboard layout? I have an action that should trigger when the `=` key is pressed. On my keyboard, that happens with `Shift+0` but on a friend's keyboard its a simple key by itself.\n\nIs there a way to define an InputEventKey that will trigger on any input that produces `=` on the keyboard? Or alternatively a different kind of InputEvent that results in the same behavior?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4933456063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]